OL,3,GNEWSAFuture uncertain after councils'
OL,4,Ashake-up shelved
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe withdrawal of government plans to
OL,7,Freorganise local government in
OL,8,FHampshire has left council leaders
OL,9,Funcertain about the future.
OL,11,FIn March, ministers announced plans to
OL,12,Fblend the county's 14 councils into
OL,13,Ffour unitary authorities from 2028.
OL,15,FOn Tuesday, the government withdrew the
OL,16,Fdecision, citing "new legal advice".
OL,18,FSome Hampshire leaders welcomed the
OL,19,Fnews, while others expressed
OL,20,Fdisappointment or criticised the
OL,21,F"costly U-turn".
